{"w":2400,"h":3106,"lines":[{"h":0.017352598525598117,"t":"Audioscripts","y":0.058910910023501462,"w":0.11309295654296872,"c":1,"x":0.13706254418427208},{"t":"We've got an exciting new project starting this year. Up until now, we've mainly focused","y":0.10289311119002498,"c":1,"x":0.13699366167343441,"w":0.64326726277669277,"h":0.023380075664728994},{"y":0.12068859341935012,"h":0.019652266542295904,"w":0.66569152832031253,"c":1,"x":0.13708228997387817,"t":"on projects to do with education and training. And we'll continue with our reading project in"},{"y":0.13587174780542011,"c":1,"x":0.13706578773541936,"w":0.73709620157877609,"t":"schools and our work with local charities. But we've also agreed to help out on a conservation Q14","h":0.020354700180613805},{"t":"project in Redfern Park. So if any of you fancy being outside and getting your hands dirty, this","y":0.15055344153827854,"w":0.68832895914713543,"h":0.022500717939289538,"x":0.13704266854600688,"c":1},{"c":1,"h":0.01458916722461634,"x":0.13533834529427963,"y":0.16860465134997549,"t":"is the project for you.","w":0.15977443695068361},{"t":"I also want to mention the annual Digital Inclusion Day, which is coming up next month. The","w":0.67513559977213544,"c":1,"y":0.19035612962919857,"x":0.1351612403007014,"h":0.02025115804678379},{"y":0.19622093025334508,"w":0.03571428616841632,"c":1,"x":0.83458646583914198,"h":0.013081395234588844,"t":"Q15"},{"t":"aim of this is to help older people keep up with technology. And this year, instead of hosting","x":0.13521802069177397,"w":0.67322291056315109,"y":0.20605373636244162,"h":0.019670999825422864,"c":1},{"h":0.021608734622127534,"y":0.2207459122203842,"t":"the event in our own training facility, we're using the ICT suite at Hill College, as it can hold","c":1,"x":0.13515485879810152,"w":0.667647450764974},{"w":0.12593985239664715,"h":0.01481004507405026,"t":"far more people.","x":0.13533834437163947,"c":1,"y":0.23824855093614716},{"t":"We've invited over 60 people from the Silver Age Community Centre to take part, so we'll","c":1,"y":0.2595591095816181,"w":0.65638254801432294,"h":0.021510662759263832,"x":0.13513300181602328},{"x":0.13511110185667263,"w":0.34261617024739582,"h":0.01891867299273331,"c":1,"t":"need a lot of volunteers to help with this event.","y":0.27488596781415819},{"y":0.29914833815535058,"h":0.019611763938810478,"w":0.66386520385742187,"c":1,"x":0.13330065541885092,"t":"If you're interested in taking part, please go to the volunteering section of our website and"},{"c":1,"x":0.83270676619544404,"y":0.3052325581581844,"h":0.013081395234588844,"w":0.033834587732950783,"t":"Q16"},{"h":0.018630964250926918,"x":0.1333843604593872,"c":1,"t":"complete the relevant form. We won't be providing any training for this but you'll be paired","y":0.31607433618053482,"w":0.66181350708007813},{"x":0.13328027112845794,"w":0.66952031453450511,"c":1,"h":0.022646897236762054,"t":"with an experienced volunteer if you've never done it before. By the way, don't forget to tell","y":0.32907796208507478},{"t":"your manager about any volunteering activities you decide to do.","x":0.13330600066927634,"y":0.34601198236756514,"h":0.018894969303993259,"c":1,"w":0.47964416503906249},{"x":0.13328317768681566,"y":0.38466589280180441,"t":"The participants on the Digital Inclusion Day really benefited. The majority were in their","w":0.6413024393717448,"h":0.020464524406044959,"c":1},{"y":0.4021881302435748,"x":0.13151845094940143,"c":1,"t":"seventies, though some were younger and a few were even in their nineties! Quite a few","w":0.65238530476888024,"h":0.016687889369318532},{"c":1,"x":0.13328405342869815,"y":0.41585951094936169,"t":"owned both a computer and a mobile phone, but these tended to be outdated models","w":0.63006556193033858,"h":0.020283708246922494},{"w":0.66002304077148444,"t":"They generally knew how to do simple things, like send texts, but weren't aware of recent","h":0.01971114748766245,"c":1,"x":0.13143912690643825,"y":0.43283776002937069},{"w":0.65632039388020824,"t":"developments in mobile phone technology. A few were keen to learn but most were quite","y":0.44777663301974135,"h":0.019787548897885032,"c":1,"x":0.1314365262673825},{"y":0.4629163207282293,"x":0.13145658052795264,"c":1,"t":"dismissive at first - they couldn't see the point of updating their skills. But that soon changed","w":0.68070159912109374,"h":0.019824027401051603},{"t":"The feedback was very positive. The really encouraging thing was that participants all","w":0.6318874613444011,"h":0.020060343352426457,"c":1,"x":0.13140687032069023,"y":0.48648008459903025},{"h":0.019655634799620736,"c":1,"x":0.12957953775564021,"t":"said they felt much more confident about using social media to keep in touch with their","y":0.50268464579218541,"w":0.64124537150065097},{"h":0.020142964217560011,"c":1,"y":0.5177897351300218,"t":"grandchildren, who prefer this form of communication to phoning or sending emails. A lot","x":0.13140875339968811,"w":0.65448928833007813},{"c":1,"x":0.13142262308468255,"h":0.02010493699151783,"y":0.53329773958491822,"w":0.66011286417643233,"t":"of them also said playing online games would help them make new friends and keep their"},{"w":0.67516474405924487,"c":1,"x":0.13139688043370881,"h":0.021402669735900548,"y":0.54860094626836997,"t":"brains active. They weren't that impressed with being able to order their groceries online, as"},{"y":0.56395380339812917,"h":0.021271677993607296,"t":"they liked going out to the shops, but some said it would come in handy if they were ill or the","x":0.12952536330102229,"w":0.68078643798828131,"c":1},{"y":0.57974862418983342,"c":1,"h":0.021381405193576897,"t":"weather was really bad. One thing they asked about was using tablets for things like reading","w":0.68077896118164061,"x":0.1295411396747618},{"h":0.022782639542166416,"c":1,"t":"newspapers - some people had been given tablets as presents but had never used them, so","x":0.12949672776842316,"y":0.59477211266132646,"w":0.68458811442057288},{"y":0.61185077754886752,"h":0.01759683064929296,"x":0.12956622463114548,"t":"that's something we'll make sure we include this time ...","w":0.4119075266520183,"c":1},{"h":0.014534883321060788,"x":0.8308270673539967,"y":0.4215116280614899,"c":1,"w":0.03571428616841632,"t":"Q17"},{"t":"Q18","x":0.8308270669417952,"y":0.45348837211381032,"w":0.033834587732950783,"h":0.013081395234588733,"c":1},{"y":0.4927325581581844,"w":0.033834587732951005,"h":0.013081395234588844,"x":0.82894736769920341,"t":"Q19","c":1},{"y":0.52325581397213794,"w":0.035714286168416431,"t":"Q20","c":1,"x":0.82894736810000225,"h":0.013081395234588733},{"x":0.12969924707294173,"t":"SECTION 3","w":0.14285714467366539,"y":0.6699935608196983,"h":0.016097875080489321,"c":1},{"x":0.12969925426386963,"y":0.69896973601223011,"t":"TUTOR: Ah ... come in, Russ.","w":0.21992479960123701,"h":0.01481004507405026,"c":1},{"h":0.0087209303610875644,"w":0.03947368303934734,"c":1,"y":0.71656976735337108,"t":"RUSS:","x":0.12969924860668389},{"t":"Thank you.","w":0.089264068603515628,"y":0.71432257959519552,"c":1,"x":0.18575827702461487,"h":0.015019340048431973},{"x":0.12781954821650762,"y":0.7325581395938634,"w":0.04887218157450357,"h":0.010174418447559619,"c":1,"t":"TUTOR:"},{"y":0.72784768751666606,"h":0.022456727331865212,"x":0.17465981504465711,"w":0.62814437866210937,"t":"Now you wanted to consult me about your class presentation on nanotechnology -","c":1},{"x":0.18796992435253662,"y":0.74694140350088079,"w":0.33646616617838548,"h":0.016139992113966994,"t":"you're due to give it in next week, aren't you?","c":1},{"t":"RUSS:","y":0.76286880569004722,"h":0.012053086231081811,"c":1,"x":0.12584548961370237,"w":0.043421802520751979},{"w":0.61109553019205731,"t":"That's right. And I'm really struggling. I chose the topic because I didn't know much","y":0.76110439488649462,"h":0.018293528117752866,"c":1,"x":0.18975366010679182},{"c":1,"x":0.18780718316517617,"h":0.02179295281326088,"w":0.58497400919596354,"y":0.77481928758320839,"t":"about it and wanted to learn more, but now I've read so much about it, in a way"},{"x":0.1877987741233223,"h":0.020843341284541239,"w":0.60372675577799484,"t":"there's too much to say - I could talk for much longer than the twenty minutes I've","c":1,"y":0.79114413727340094},{"c":1,"y":0.80785337526660106,"x":0.18784022447149121,"h":0.021207314495570562,"t":"been allocated. Should I assume the other students don't know much, and give them. Q21","w":0.67129816691080735},{"h":0.01940433455526791,"c":1,"y":0.82281138021895273,"x":0.18784606532496675,"t":"a kind of general introduction, or should I try and make them share my fascination","w":0.60555038452148446},{"c":1,"t":"with a particular aspect?","w":0.18421052296956378,"h":0.013210552704387979,"y":0.83998712164957445,"x":0.18609022715276027},{"w":0.045112781524658196,"t":"TUTOR:","y":0.85755813945166037,"x":0.12781954898922368,"c":1,"h":0.0087209303610876754},{"h":0.023232184297717562,"x":0.18586871708308195,"t":"You could do either, but you'll need to have it clear in your own mind.","y":0.85168041256976956,"w":0.51178024291992186,"c":1},{"w":0.039473683039347313,"c":1,"t":"RUSS:","h":0.011627907148116789,"x":0.12593985020025117,"y":0.87209302311198822},{"x":0.18593522387681721,"y":0.87019901107418118,"h":0.016102127620503004,"w":0.242823486328125,"c":1,"t":"Then I think I'll give an overview."},{"t":"TUTOR:","y":0.8880813952050115,"h":0.011627907148116789,"c":1,"x":0.12406015022997788,"w":0.05075188000996908},{"y":0.88307914648415986,"c":1,"x":0.18401516213785404,"h":0.023246895322781236,"w":0.55116572062174474,"t":"OK. Now, one way of approaching this is to work through developments in"},{"w":0.15037593841552735,"x":0.18609022640258574,"y":0.90261627922695253,"t":"chronological order.","h":0.014640642916549873,"c":1},{"t":"RUSS:","w":0.039473683039347313,"x":0.12593985020025117,"y":0.91860465101896494,"h":0.011627907148116789,"c":1},{"t":"Uh-huh.","x":0.18571116929399342,"y":0.91745042602085847,"h":0.015269178155922325,"w":0.064838123321533186,"c":1},{"h":0.014534883321060788,"t":"104","w":0.033834587732950838,"y":0.94040697690137109,"c":1,"x":0.12593984890221099}]}